<div class="drawer-backdrop" data-drawer-close></div><aside class="cart-drawer" data-cart-drawer aria-hidden="true"><header><div><span class="eyebrow">LumaForm / your edit</span><h2>Cart <span data-cart-count>{{ cart.item_count }}</span></h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-drawer-close>×</button></header><div class="gift-panel"><b>✦ Complimentary gift</b><p>Spend $75 or more and choose one tool with our compliments.</p><div class="gift-choices"><button data-gift-choice="Cooling wand">Cooling wand</button><button data-gift-choice="Facial roller">Facial roller</button><button data-gift-choice="Travel set">Travel set</button></div><small data-gift-status>Choose one qualifying gift.</small></div><div class="drawer-body"><div class="shipping-progress"><span>Free shipping at <b>$75</b></span><i style="width:{{ cart.total_price | divided_by: 75.0 | at_most: 100 }}%"></i></div>{% if cart.item_count == 0 %}<div class="empty-state"><span>◇</span><h3>Your cart is empty</h3><p>Discover a small upgrade for your daily ritual.</p><a class="button dark" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Continue shopping</a></div>{% else %}{% for item in cart.items %}<div class="cart-item">{% if item.image %}{{ item.image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag }}{% endif %}<div><h3>{{ item.product.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</p><button data-cart-change data-line="{{ forloop.index }}" data-quantity="{{ item.quantity | minus: 1 }}">−</button> {{ item.quantity }} <button data-cart-change data-line="{{ forloop.index }}" data-quantity="{{ item.quantity | plus: 1 }}">＋</button><a href="{{ item.url_to_remove }}" data-remove-item>Remove</a></div></div>{% endfor %}{% endif %}<div class="drawer-recs"><span class="eyebrow">You may also like</span><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Facial tools</a><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Gift sets</a></div></div><footer><form class="discount-form"><input placeholder="Discount code"><button type="button">Apply</button></form><div class="drawer-total"><span>Subtotal</span><b>{{ cart.total_price | money }}</b></div><a class="button accent full" href="{{ routes.checkout_url }}">Checkout →</a><small>Taxes and shipping calculated at checkout.</small></footer></aside>